{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1017632-energy-weapons-still-vulgar","id":1017632,"title":"Energy Weapons, Still Vulgar?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-15T07:06:12-08:00","id":1017632,"title":"Energy Weapons, Still Vulgar?","content":"Have we come to the point that laser and possibly even plasma and particle beam weapons are coincedental? We've had laser tracking and targeting for decades now. So if all of a sudden we saw someone (especially military) use a wierd plastic and ceramic rifle type weapon to blow the hell out of something would we really go &quot;WTF&quot; or more be like &quot;I want one&quot;?<br /> <br /> On this note, at what timeline (decade) do you think this would have become accepted? 90s, 80s, sooner?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/987-tuch","name":"Tuch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar987_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-15T07:36:19-08:00","id":1017643,"title":"","content":"Depends.<br /> <br /> If somebody goes 'pew pew' with a plasmagun on the street, my eyeballs'd be bulging out. Because that's, really, still rather scifi. Common scifi trope, but scifi. OrtThings you see in Marvel movies. But not in RL.<br /> <br /> *Military* might be an exception, yes. DARPA research is a thing, and suddenly seeing something like that,in the hands of a soldier, in a combat theatre...might probably be coincidental.<br /> <br /> But pretty much not anywhere else.<br /> If, ever, energy weapons become officially part of Law Enforcement or common military equipment, then yes..they will be coincidental everywhere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-15T08:10:19-08:00","id":1017655,"title":"","content":"There's going to be several rounds of bouncing the idea back and forth between serious military developers and the entertainment industry. Each one will see some preliminary public testing which will give rise to energy weapon presence in television and movies which fades as it becomes apparent fantasy has outpaced reality. Each round will get the idea closer to reality until finally there is a prototype which is somewhat reliable and small enough to be portable. At that point the idea is pretty much in the consensus.<br /> <br /> Fun historical note: Facial recognition software happened because someone in the CIA saw a bond film where a computer could recognize faces and wanted to know if we could do that.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-15T08:46:22-08:00","id":1017669,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ramnesis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1017632-energy-weapons-still-vulgar?p=1017655#post1017655\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's going to be several rounds of bouncing the idea back and forth between serious military developers and the entertainment industry. Each one will see some preliminary public testing which will give rise to energy weapon presence in television and movies which fades as it becomes apparent fantasy has outpaced reality. Each round will get the idea closer to reality until finally there is a prototype which is somewhat reliable and small enough to be portable. At that point the idea is pretty much in the consensus.<br /> <br /> Fun historical note: Facial recognition software happened because someone in the CIA saw a bond film where a computer could recognize faces and wanted to know if we could do that.</div> </div> </div> </div>It would be interesting to see where the folks who put it into the movie got it from....<br /> <br /> Both seem like perfect examples of the interplay between It-X's R&amp;D and the Syndicate's marketing... <br /> <br /> This is the way that new technology gets to the Masses. (Goes from being a spontaneous casting &amp; Foci, to a Procedure &amp; Foci, to a Device to.... everyone).<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-15T08:50:13-08:00","id":1017670,"title":"","content":"Yes, direct energy weapons are still impossible because of waste heat concerns (plasma weapons are always going to be impossible because of the difficulty of directing a plasma charge outside of a electro-static or magnetic field). Any Mage who uses an energy weapon should still be smacked upside the head with paradox from a vulgar effect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-15T08:59:26-08:00","id":1017674,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1017632-energy-weapons-still-vulgar?p=1017670#post1017670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, direct energy weapons are still impossible because of waste heat concerns (plasma weapons are always going to be impossible because of the difficulty of directing a plasma charge outside of a electro-static or magnetic field). Any Mage who uses an energy weapon should still be smacked upside the head with paradox from a vulgar effect.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is it the engineering problem that makes it vulgar, or the fact that it's vulgar that evinces as an engineering problem?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-15T10:25:59-08:00","id":1017702,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ajax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1017632-energy-weapons-still-vulgar?p=1017674#post1017674\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Is it the engineering problem that makes it vulgar, or the fact that it's vulgar that evinces as an engineering problem?</div> </div> </div> </div>It is the former.<br /> No